<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2: </span>Comparison of mAP scores on VisualNews <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib22" title="" class="ltx_ref">Liu et al., 2021</a>)</cite> across different input lengths for DistilBERT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citeyearpar">(<a href="#bib.bib34" title="" class="ltx_ref">2020</a>)</cite> and <span id="S4.T2.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">HERO</span>. <span id="S4.T2.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif">HERO</span> consistently outperforms DistilBERT across all lengths and generators. For length-specialist models, we use the expert closest in length, defaulting to the longer one when in between.</figcaption>
</figure>
